Branch 2 Phase 3 Android Capture Durability + Safe Saved Recording Retry, 2026-10-23.
Android version 3.3.2 / code 8. Parent PC Inno version remains 0.4.5.
Completed audio is saved atomically in Android app-private storage BEFORE network upload.
Verified IDs/checksums, retry from Saved Recordings, versioned analysis JSON, no silent
replacement with an older recording, stale caregiver review cleared on new capture.
Android APK build source and compiled-artifact gates retained; Live Recording removal
