The opt-in Reference Audio Library provides a Search References button, exact
student speaker-ID/kind filtering, no stale results from older searches, and
clear guidance for empty reference libraries versus saved recordings.
Android APK workflow recovery directions are in WORKFLOWS_FIX_README.md.
Inno remains 0.4.8, Android remains 3.3.3/code9; Main remains frozen.

